# LF line endings enforced for text files (WSL dev).
# The WSL checkout used to materialize CRLF working copies (Windows-origin
# leftovers) even though HEAD blobs were LF, which broke publish.sh's anchored
# greps. eol=lf keeps working trees LF on every platform; PNGs are binary and
# must never be normalized.
* text=auto
*.go text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.png binary
